97
00:11:43.980 --> 00:11:48.520
(We have intercepted them. This is accurate.). The Future You're Paying For.

98
00:11:49.540 --> 00:11:56.500
Somewhere in the future, there's a Tuesday when: Cancer is a minor inconvenience like a cold.

99
00:11:57.200 --> 00:12:02.560
Hearts are as repairable as carburetors. Death is optional, not mandatory.

100
00:12:03.400 --> 00:12:12.160
Aging is something that happened to your ancestors. Every day between now and that Tuesday costs you one point zero nine

101
00:12:12.160 --> 00:12:19.980
